<description>Read after a completed run that used the built-in reporter.
A custom reporter does not update this summary.</description>
*)
{attribute 'monitoring' := 'call'}
PROPERTY FINAL DefaultAdsRunSummary : TOF_Core.ERROR_MESSAGE]]></Declaration>
